# The function runner. It deploys to its own VM via sandbox/deploy.sh and is never built into
# any image here - all three Dockerfiles copy only `server` and `client` - so keeping it out of
# the build context saves uploading the provisioning scripts and the runtime image sources to
# the daemon on every build.
sandbox
